+#   Upstream appended the same path id to both CSMS URLs.
+# - Accept ids that are not strictly alphanumeric, including hyphenated ones.
+# - Disable WebSocket pings on the charger-facing server. The Elinta HomeBox
+#   does not answer PINGs, and upstream only set ping_timeout, so the library
