+# - A dead secondary CSMS must not tear down the primary session.
+# - Force the ocpp1.6 subprotocol and disable permessage-deflate.
+# - Optional HTTP Basic auth toward the primary CSMS.
+# - Explicit default SSL context for wss:// so system CA certificates are used.
 
